    "detailed_description": "Boarberry Farm is a 'farm defence' game, coined by our game developer Daniel as a fun mashup of the farming simulator and tower defence genres. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou harvest crops on the farm while fending off hungry boars who try to invade. Play solo or with a friend in our multiplayer setting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlant and water many tasty crops, armed with a bow and arrow to keep them safe from the pesky boars. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe goal of each day is to fulfil an ever-growing quota within the time limit. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's a time management test - will you prioritize planting crops, fixing fences, or fending off boars? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome main reference points for the game include the chaotic friendship destroyer cooking sim Overcooked 2 and the action roguelite farming sim Atomicrops. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features: <br />\r\nPlant an array of delicious crops \ud83c\udf36\ufe0f <br />\r\nPlay solo or with a friend \ud83d\udc6b <br />\r\nGet into the farm feel with an awesome soundtrack! \ud83c\udfb6 <br />\r\nDevelop your aim and shoo away the hungry boars \ud83c\udff9 <br />\r\nMaster the challenge of different difficulty levels \ud83d\udcc8 <br />\r\nUnlock exciting upgrades including stylish cooking pot helmets for added boar protection \ud83d\udc17 <br />\r\nGain personal buffs by eating the crops yourself \ud83d\udcaa",
